Subject: [PATCH 0003] Classify Codex 'stream disconnected before completion' as ApiConnectionClosedError

Applies on top of profile 'pristine'.

--- a/harbor/agents/installed/base.py
+++ b/harbor/agents/installed/base.py
@@ -310,6 +310,10 @@
             ApiResponseStalledError,
         ),
         ErrorPattern(
+            r"stream disconnected before completion|stream closed before response\.completed",
+            ApiConnectionClosedError,
+        ),
+        ErrorPattern(
             r"response exceeded .+ output token maximum",
             OutputTokenExceededError,
         ),
